@startuml
' Draft v0.1, 2026-11-09; UC-013, FR-PERS-001-005/014, DATA-WEAR-001.
' BRULE-PERS-001/003/006, BRULE-OUT-008; US-PERS-001; PR #4 / DD-007.
title AD-013 - Provide supported typed-target feedback
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
|User|
start
:Choose identified target and Like / Dislike / clear;
|CapsuleAI|
:Resolve user and target kind / origin / source reference;
if (Accessible identified target and authorized user?) then (Yes)
  if (AI Today / Chat suggestion?) then (Yes)
    :Allow Like, Dislike or clearing current feedback;
  else (Community post)
    if (Requested Dislike?) then (Yes)
      :Reject unsupported action; retain prior state;
      stop
    else (Like / clear)
      :Allow Like or clearing current Like;
    endif
  endif
else (No)
  :Explain unavailable / denied target; mutate nothing;
  stop
endif
:Attempt supported state change;
if (Acceptance established?) then (Yes)
  :Show one accepted effective state or cleared state;
  :Store user-expressed evidence with action time;
else (Failed / uncertain)
  :Retain prior state on known failure;
  :Explain uncertainty; review before safe retry;
endif
note right
  Matching garment sets do not alias AI and Community targets.
  No Wear / ownership from feedback.
  No fixed weights, decay or mandatory ranking effect.
  Future ranking cannot bypass hard validity.
end note
stop
@enduml
